{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/845797-geist-2e-archetype-inflicting-tilts","id":845797,"title":"Geist 2E: Archetype inflicting Tilts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-11T13:06:54-08:00","id":845797,"title":"Geist 2E: Archetype inflicting Tilts?","content":"So, in an effort to make Archtype have more of a direct impact, I was thinking it might let you inflict an appropriate Tilt upon a target or the Scene (modeled on the Conditions certain Auspices can inflict in Werewolf 2E). As well as offer an RP specific method of regaining Plasm a bit quicker than the current model.<br /> <br /> Here's my heavily second-guessed and vague notes, thus far:<ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Reaper: Reaper\u2019s Mark (bonuses toward the target\u2019s death), regain Plasm by ritually dedicating kills.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Celebrant: Celebrant\u2019s Revelry (inter-social rolls easier and party to regain willpower like a Vice), regain Plasm from new experiences/indulging their Vice.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mourner: Mourner\u2019s Wake (???), regain Plasm by disassociating with your previous life.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Gatekeeper: Gatekeeper\u2019s Lock (disrupts Manifestations and channeling), regain Plasm by ejecting ghosts from the living world, or the living from the Underworld/Twilight.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pilgrim: Pilgrim\u2019s Path (promotes feelings of peace and contentment, and prevents things from becoming Anchors), regain Plasm by freeing/severing people from potential Anchors.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Advocate: Advocate\u2019s Hearing (bonus to ghostly interaction and forces ghost to give the Advocate a chance to speak), regain Plasm by resolving ghostly business.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Necromancer: Necromancer\u2019s Insight (ghostly numina become easier or harder to activate), regain Plasm by finding out something about a ghost/the dead/the Underworld.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bonepicker: Bonepicker\u2019s Bazaar (???), regain Plasm but acquiring items or services you wouldn\u2019t have been able to before your Bargain.</span></span></li> </ul><br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T16:00:54-08:00","id":845856,"title":"","content":"With my 2e conversion I took a leaf out of Demon's book and made archetypes give a condition that gives plasm instead of beats when you do something thematically appropriate, and can be resolved to make unlocking a manifestion cost nothing if your doing the thematic thing.<br /> <br /> The idea of being able to give other people tilts is interesting though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T06:51:19-08:00","id":846057,"title":"","content":"Archetype already has an impact as probably the most reliable way to get Plasm and discount Manifestaiton costs; it's not very well highlighted though. Making it into a Condition for 2E makes sense to me too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T09:13:15-07:00","id":847118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/845797-geist-2e-archetype-inflicting-tilts?p=846057#post846057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Archetype already has an impact as probably the most reliable way to get Plasm and discount Manifestaiton costs; it's not very well highlighted though. Making it into a Condition for 2E makes sense to me too.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, on the Plasm-recovery side, I was thinking of a small, quick option too. Like the Willpower recovery methods for the Virtue/Vice replacers - big effort leads to a full recharge, small effort leads to a point.<br /> <br /> As for the Tilts, part of it was to mirror Werewolf 2E (which Sin-Eaters kinda-sorta-funhouse mirror on the ghost side of things), and the other part was so that a Reaper is actually better at killing, a Celebrant at partying, a Necromancer with dead stuff, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T18:19:44-07:00","id":847949,"title":"","content":"I am also considering having archetype specific merits and making it so each archetype has an additional breaking point for if you act directly opposite to how your archetype.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T18:02:07-07:00","id":848516,"title":"","content":"I hadn't considered that, but I like the idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T19:15:49-07:00","id":848549,"title":"","content":"Here is the basic gist of how I structure archetypes:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bonepicker</span></span></b><br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">quote-y soundy text</span></span></i><br /> <br /> Four to five paragraph description of bonepickers. Lorem ipsum, etc. etc<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Nicknames</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: Cryptkeeper, glutton, ghoul, graverobber, mummy</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Breaking Point</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: Allow someone to take away something that makes your life considerably comfortable without resistance.</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Concepts</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: Magician who uses ghosts for his tricks, a true medium, a thief who can unlock any door, student who uses ghosts to cheat on her tests, a guy who manipulates the neighbourhood around his home with ghosts to make it safer at night. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Condition</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: Resting in Peace.</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Krewe</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: Bonepickers lend themselves to taking on the position of being a Conjurer or Maven.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Resting in Peace - Archetype Condition</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Your character sees living comfortably as one of their primary concerns and isn\u2019t above using ghosts and their supernatural talents to achives this comfort. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Plasm</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Take advantage of a ghost or one of your sin-eater abilities in such a way that it increases your standard of living. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resolution</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: This can be resolved whenever the Sin-Eater is unlocking a seal with the goal of directly improve their quality of life, causing this instance of unlocking the seal to not cost any plasm or willpower. </span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}